    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This excellent 2 bedroom ground floor apartment is situated in Grange Rath, Drogheda, Co. Meath. The well planned and spacious interiors are flooded with natural light and extend to c. 76 sq.m (818 sq.ft). No. 47 Park Wood benefits from beautifully present communal landscaped rear gardens & is situated close to the Grange Rath forest, football pitches & tennis courts. Briefly, this is a quality home located within easy access of schools, shopping, the M1 Motorway and bus routes into both Drogheda and Dublin City Centre. Located within a stroll of South Gate Shopping Centre (Dunnes Stores, Restaurants, Butchers, etc.), Grange Rath is located just off the Dublin Road where you can find Drogheda Train Station & 5 minutes drive from Mornington Beach. \n\nAMV 245,000 For Sale by Private Treaty\n\nFeatures \n2 Bedroom Ground-Floor Apartment\nBuilt C. 2003\nExtends to C. 76 sq. m. (818 Sq. ft.)\nG-F-C-H \nGas Fire\nDouble Glazing Throughout\nUpgraded External Doors\nStorage Room\nRear Patio Area\nSunny West Facing Rear Orientation\nWired For Alarm\nAmple Parking\n\nAccommodation Includes \nEntrance Hall (1.82m x 1.60m)\nLiving / Dining Area (5.07m x 5.61m)\nKitchen (2.62m x 3.03m)\nBedroom 1(4.53m x 2.90m)\nEn Suite (1.80m x 1.05m)\nBedroom 2 (2.58m x 3.71m)\nMain Bathroom (1.80m x 2.18m)\n\nBuilding Energy Rating\nBER: D2 \nBER No. 110515582\n\n\nViewing Details \nStrictly by appointment with the sole selling agent\n\n\n"
      },
